                        <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-violet-600 hover:bg-violet-500 text-neutral-900 font-bold py-4 rounded-xl shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(139,92,246,0.3)] transition-all uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mt-2">Commit State</button>
